==Trivia==
*First team known for running the Odin B Main wallbang spray on Ascent in a competitive play.
*First winners of an international event of the VALORANT Champions Tour. ([[VALORANT_Champions_Tour/2021/Stage_2/Masters|VCT 2021: Stage 2 Masters - Reykjavík]]) <ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.oneesports.gg/valorant/sentinels-win-valorant-championship/|title=Sentinels win first-ever global Valorant championship in a perfect run|date=2021-05-31|author=[[ONE Esports]]}}</ref>
*Sentinels and [[Gen.G Esports]] were the oldest (average 23.4) roster at [[VCT/2024/Stage_1/Masters|Masters Madrid]]. <ref>{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FionnOnFire/status/1767463950889959857|title=Average ages of the teams competing at VCT Madrid Masters)|date=2024-03-12|author=[[FionnOnFire]]}}</ref>
*First team to win 2 VCT Masters events, winning [[VALORANT_Champions_Tour/2021/Stage_2/Masters|Masters Reykjavík 2021]] and [[VCT/2024/Stage_1/Masters|Masters Madrid 2024]].

